{
  "objective": "Using validation-only evidence, produce bounded research and risk directives for the frozen Phase 12 protocol. Never access test metrics.",
  "mode": "dry_run",
  "rationale": "The dataset 'CrossMarketAgentGym formal_v3' has been inspected and found valid (73,193 rows, 80 symbols across CN, HK, JP, US markets). To bound research safely, we propose a validation-only plan that confirms data integrity, enumerates available markets and symbols, creates a validation split aligned with the frozen Phase 12 protocol, validates experiment configuration, and estimates compute budget—all without touching test metrics.",
